BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:African Fusion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T193000
UID:632021ea1b9e4efc3b47407bfba8d881642026_2:19:38_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:As we close out another academic year\, we invite you to the A
 frican Fusion 2026\, a celebration of community\, culture\, and achievemen
 t.\n\nThis year has been marked by resilience\, perseverance\, and solidar
 ity. Amid ongoing immigration uncertainties and the challenges faced by ma
 ny international students and scholars\, our community has continued to su
 pport one another and thrive together. In the spirit of the African prover
 b\, “It takes a village\,” we gather to celebrate the strength of our 
 village.\n\nAfrican Fusion is more than a cultural event. It is an opportu
 nity to honor our graduating students for their achievements and recognize
  the faculty\, mentors\, staff\, and supporters who have helped shape thei
 r journeys.\n\nJoin us for an evening of African food\, culture\, music\, 
 and fellowship as we celebrate our graduates\, express gratitude to those 
 who have supported us\, and close out the year in unity and joy.\n\nBecaus
 e when one of us succeeds\, the whole village celebrates. 🎓✨🌍🧡
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908869
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
